YOUR TASK: Complete this task: Implement the complete Python solution using the derived formula: read N, S, and T; check that each S character maps to a single T character; compute C = number of present S letters c with target[c] != c; compute indeg from present sources; count closed directed cycles of length >= 2 (all vertices have indeg == 1); compute image_count = number of letters with indeg > 0; output -1 if closed_cycles > 0 and image_count == 26, otherwise C + closed_cycles. Run the four samples and basic edge cases to verify.